{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15524","headline":"山居酬韦苏州见寄 · 畅当","name":"山居酬韦苏州见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤柴泄烟处，此中山叟居。\n观云宁有事，耽酒讵知余。\n水定鹤翻去，松歌峰俨如。\n犹烦使君问，更欲结深庐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"畅当","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15524.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15524","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}